     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">All,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Is it possible to do kriging (interpolate points) in ggmap?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I do not want the “<span style=\"color:#102040\">stat_density2d”</span> function, but a function that would interpolate data to give me a contour map as attached.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks, <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i>Jean-Paul Huys<u></u><u></u></i></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i>Air Quality Specialist | ph <a href=\"tel:(702)%20455-1684\" value=\"+17024551684\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">702.455.1684</a><u></u><u></u></i></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:blue\">hu...@ClarkCountyNV.gov</span></a><u></u><u></u></i></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i>Clark County Dept of Air Quality<u></u><u></u></i></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i>4701 W Russell Rd, Suite 200, Las Vegas, NV 89118<u></u><u></u></i></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
